00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:48.400
plus tools, plus a loop. A user makes a request, the AI model thinks, and then it decides to call

62
00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:53.520
a tool. Your application code executes that tool and returns the result back to the AI.

63
00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:57.360
The AI reads the result, thinks again, and either calls another tool or provides

64
00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.600
a final answer. That loop, that's the hands that actually do the work.

