00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:16.240
fixed menu where cooks work side-by-side on predefined tasks. But the orchestrator

68
00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:19.920
worker pattern, it's completely different. It's like a brilliant head chef reading a

69
00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:24.320
custom order dynamically inventing the necessary subtasks on the fly, explicitly

70
00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:28.880
passing the exact needed context to specialized sub-agent workers, and then finally synthesizing

71
00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:33.920
the perfect dish. Remember, sub-agents don't automatically inherit the parent conversation.

